{"data":{"body":"**P3:** This pruning remains racy because `pollUntilReady()` can complete its future immediately after `removeIf` runs. The entry then remains present and the batch issues an unnecessary empty backend request; if that response omits the operation, the completed entry survives until another batch or shutdown. Add an explicit unregister-and-complete operation synchronized with batch selection, plus a test that completes READY between pruning and request dispatch.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-DtsH","finding_digest":"58999337e70e61f15773ad6dbbe1814d7728b4e8111c2b58e523379f6f798503","finding_id":"arf_v1_lcmzgn7hbzq7cv3tvvw3xymbjv","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::polluntilready::completed-poll-registration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::polluntilready::completed-poll-registration-leak","line":205,"observation_digest":"2f57551ee00047f8b46e09988eb8fde8de0b28905dca03864ef9015bb5c02c44","observation_id":"aro_v1_f5lvkhxaabd7rndobgmi5oh55d","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/CheckpointManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_lcmzgn7hbzq7cv3tvvw3xymbjv","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_klofqxa3duor6j4p7tamg2dlro","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"0df995cc72950fb51fd2045758a88cdebad1b71b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":202,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_meovbjzi4ti6losl2cabzgi2rs","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
